\p
\v 1 Then Adam \add ≈slept with¦1394\add* his¦1385 wife¦1385 Havvah¦1384 \add !(Eve¦1384)\add*, and she conceived¦1386 and \add in due course\add* gave¦1387 birth¦1387 to Kayin (Cain¦1390). “Yahweh¦1396 \add ≈has¦1392 enabled me to produce\add* a man¦1393,” she said¦1391.
