\v 17 After¦5691 \add Abram\add* returned¦5692 from¦5693 \add defeating\add* Kedorlaomer¦5696 and¦5699 his allied kings¦5701, the king of¦5687 Sodom¦5689 went¦5686 out¦5686 to¦5704 meet¦5690 \add Abram\add* in Shaveh¦5707 valley (also¦5699 called the king's¦5710 valley) .
