\v 18 Then¦5712 Malki-Tsedek¦5712 \add !(Melchizedek¦5712)\add* the king¦5715 of¦5715 Salem¦5716 brought¦5717 out¦5717 bread¦5718 and¦5712 wine¦5719—he was¦5721 a priest¦5721 to the most¦5723 high¦5723 God¦5722.\x + \xo 14:18-20: \xt Heb 7:1-10.\x*
\v 19 \add @Malki-Tsedek\add* blessed¦5725 \add Abram\add*, saying¦5726:
