\v 20 \add But\add* as for Yishma'el¦6716, I've¦6718 heard¦6718 \add your request\add*. Listen, I'll bless¦6721 him and make him fruitful¦6723 and give¦6734 him very many¦6725 descendants. He'll¦6733 father¦6733 twelve rulers and I'll make him into a great¦6736 nation¦6735,
\v 21 however, my¦6740 agreement¦6740 will be established¦6741 with¦6751 Yitshak¦6744, who Sarah¦6748 will give birth to¦6747 by this¦6750 time¦6749 next year¦6751.”
\v 22 Then¦6754 having finished¦6754 speaking¦6755 with¦6756 Abraham¦6760, God¦6758 went up \add away\add* from¦6759 him¦6756.
\p
\v 23 Then¦6762 Abraham¦6763 took¦6762 every¦6778 male¦6780 from his household¦6772 and circumcised¦6784 them that¦6791 very day¦6790, just¦6792 as¦6792 God¦6795 had¦6793 instructed him¦6794. That¦6783 included his son¦6767 Yishma'el¦6766, all¦6774 those¦6771 born¦6771 in¦6781 his house¦6772, and everyone¦6778 bought with¦6781 his money¦6777.
\v 24 Abraham was ninety-nine¦6800 years¦6802 old when¦6803 he¦6803 was circumcised¦6803
\v 25 and¦6807 his¦6808 son¦6808 Yishma'el¦6807 was¦6809 thirteen years¦6813 old when¦6814 \add Abraham\add* circumcised¦6814 him.
\v 26 \add So it was,\add* on¦6819 that¦6821 same day¦6820, \add both\add* Abraham¦6823 and¦6824 his¦6825 son¦6825 Yishma'el¦6824 were circumcised¦6822
\v 27 and¦6833 all¦6827 the¦6829 \add other\add* males in his household¦6830, whether born¦6831 there or bought¦6833 from¦6836 foreigners¦6839, were¦6840 circumcised¦6840 with¦6841 him¦6841.
\c 18
\s1 Abraham and Sarah are promised a son
