\v 15 But¦7055 Sarah¦7056 was¦7063 afraid¦7063 and¦7064 denied¦7055 it¦7064 by saying¦7064, “I¦7060 didn't¦7059 laugh¦7060.”
\p “No¦7066, because¦7061 you¦7068 did laugh,” he¦7064 said¦7064.
\s1 Abraham bargains with Yahweh about Sodom
