\v 7 And¦8496 she¦8500 continued¦8496, “Who¦8497 would have said¦8498 to¦8499 Abraham¦8499 that¦8497 Sarah¦8502 would breastfeed children¦8501, yet I¦8505 have \add given him\add* a son¦8506 in his¦8507 old¦8507 age¦8507.”
\s1 Hagar is expelled with Yishma'el
