\v 9 \add But\add* Sarah¦8523 noticed¦8522 that \add Yishma'el\add* (the son¦8526 of¦8526 Hagar¦8528 the Egyptian¦8529 who she¦8532 had¦8532 given birth to¦8533 for Abraham¦8533) was mocking¦8534,
\v 10 so \add Sarah\add* said¦8536 to¦8537 Abraham¦8537, “Get rid of¦8543 that slave woman and¦8536 her¦8543 son, because¦8544 that slave woman's¦8549 son won't¦8545 be inheriting¦8546 \add anything along\add* with¦8554 my¦8553 son Yitshak¦8556.”\x + \xo 21:10: \xt Gal 4:29-30.\x*
\v 11 Now this stressed out Abraham¦8562 \add who also cared for that\add* son¦8565,
