\v 14 Abraham¦8608 got up early¦8607 the \add next\add* morning¦8610, and got some bread and a skin¦8614 of¦8614 water¦8615 and helped Hagar¦8619 put them on¦8610 her shoulder¦8623. Then¦8607 he¦8616 gave¦8616 her the child and sent¦8627 her away¦8627, and she¦8628 left and wandered¦8629 in¦8610 the wilderness¦8630 around Be'er-Sheva¦8632.
