\v 17 Now God heard the boy's voice, so \add one of\add* God's¦8677 messengers¦8676 called¦8675 Hagar from¦8682 heaven¦8684 and¦8669 said¦8685 to¦8686 her¦8686, “What's¦8687 the matter, Hagar? Don't¦8691 be¦8693 afraid¦8693, because¦8694 God has¦8696 heard the boy's voice over there¦8705.
