\v 22 \add One day\add* \add King\add* Abimelech¦8770 and¦8766 Ficol¦8771, the¦8768 commander¦8772 of¦8772 his army¦8774, spoke¦8769 to¦8775 Abraham¦8777, saying¦8769, “\add We can see that\add* God¦8779 is¦8780 with¦8767 you in¦8767 everything you do¦8785.\x + \xo 21:22: \xt Gen 26:26.\x*
