\v 26 “I don't¦8835 know¦8836 who¦8837 did¦8838 that¦8842,” Abimelech¦8834 responded¦8833, “and¦8833 you¦8845 hadn't told¦8848 me¦8849 about it, so I've only¦8854 just¦8842 heard¦8853 about it today.”
