\v 32 So¦8923 the agreement¦8924 was made¦8923 at¦8925 Be'er-Sheva¦8925, then¦8923 Abimelech¦8928 and Ficol¦8929, the commander¦8930 of¦8930 his army¦8932, got up¦8927 and returned¦8933 \add home\add* to¦8934 the Philistine¦8937 region¦8936.
