\v 2 “Take¦8975 your son Yitshak¦8990 who you love¦8987, your only¦8984 son,” God commanded him, “and go¦8991 to the Moriah¦8997 region¦8996 and sacrifice him there¦8999 as a burnt¦9000 offering¦9000 on¦9001 one¦9002 of¦9003 the mountains¦9003 that¦9004 I'll¦9005 \add point out\add* to you.”\x + \xo 22:2: \xt 2Ch 3:1.\x*
