\v 3 So¦9008 Abraham¦9009 got up¦9027 early¦9008 in¦9010 the morning¦9010 and saddled¦9011 his donkey¦9014. Then he took¦9015 two¦9018 of¦9018 his young¦9019 men¦9019 with¦9010 him and his son¦9023 Yitshak¦9022, and he cut¦9024 \add some\add* firewood for the burnt¦9026 offering¦9026. Then they left to go¦9028 to the place¦9031 that¦9032 God¦9037 had¦9034 told him.
