\v 5 so¦9069 he¦9052 said¦9052 to his¦9056 young¦9056 men¦9056, “Stay here by yourselves with¦9061 the donkey¦9063 while the boy¦9065 and¦9052 I¦9064 go¦9066 over there to \add worship God\add*, then¦9052 we'll¦9066 come¦9071 back to you \add here\add*.”
