\v 6 So¦9074 Abraham¦9075 took¦9074 the firewood for the burnt¦9079 offering¦9079 and put it¦9080 on his¦9084 son¦9084 Yitshak¦9083, and he¦9085 carried the fire¦9089 pot and the knife¦9092. Then¦9074 the two of¦9094 them¦9094 went¦9093 on together¦9095,
\v 7 and¦9111 Yitshak¦9098 asked his father Abraham¦9101 his father, “My father?”
