\v 8 “God¦9118 will¦9119 provide the lamb for¦9123 the burnt¦9123 offering¦9123 himself, my son¦9124,” Abraham¦9117 answered¦9116, and¦9125 then¦9116 the two of¦9124 them¦9126 continued¦9116 on together¦9127.
