\v 9 Then they¦9129 came¦9129 to¦9130 the place¦9132 that¦9133 God¦9137 had¦9134 told him, and Abraham¦9140 built¦9138 an altar there¦9139 and arranged¦9144 the firewood \add on it\add*. Then he¦9148 tied¦9148 up his¦9152 son¦9152 Yitshak¦9151 and laid him on the altar on top of the wood.\x + \xo 22:9: \xt Jam 2:21.\x*
