\v 18 Because you¦9326 obeyed what I said, all¦9321 the nations¦9322 of¦9322 the earth¦9323 will¦9319 be blessed¦9319 through your¦9320 descendants.”\x + \xo 22:18: \xt Acts 3:25.\x*
\v 19 Then¦9329 Abraham returned¦9329 to his¦9333 young¦9333 men¦9333 and they¦9334 all continued on¦9343 \add home\add* together¦9336 to Beer¦9339-Sheva¦9340, and Abraham \add continued\add* living¦9341 \add there\add*.
