\p
\v 1 Sarah¦9429 went on to be 127 years¦9431 old
\v 2 when she¦9440 died¦9440 in \add the city of\add* Kiriat¦9442-Arba (now \add called\add* Hebron¦9445) in the Canaan¦9447 region¦9446. Abraham¦9449 went¦9448 in \add by her bed\add* to¦9450 weep¦9452 and¦9440 mourn¦9450 for¦9451 her.
