\v 5 Those descendants of¦9483 Het¦9485 replied to¦9489 Abraham¦9488, telling him¦9490,
\v 6 “My¦9494 master¦9494, listen to us. You're a \add ≈godly leader¦9495\add* among¦9498 us. \add Go ahead and\add* bury¦9501 your dead in the¦9499 choicest¦9499 of our burial¦9509 places. We've all agreed not¦9510 to prevent you¦9513 from¦9514 burying¦9514 your dead in any of our cemeteries.”
\p
\v 7 Then¦9517 Abraham¦9518 stood and¦9517 bowed¦9519 to¦9520 the Hittites¦9525 who were the land-owners,
