\v 10 Now Efron¦9579 (a Hittite¦9580) was¦9573 sitting¦9573 \add there\add* among Het's¦9577 \add other\add* descendants, so he¦9578 responded to¦9588 Abraham¦9583 while the other \add land-owners\add* were¦9589 listening, along with¦9584 everyone¦9575 else at¦9584 the city¦9592 gate¦9590,
