\v 5-7 Abraham¦10951 \add went on to\add* live to be 175 years old. He¦10950 gave¦10950 \add valuable\add* gifts to \add all\add* the sons of¦10954 his slave-wives, then¦10950 he forced them to move to the east to ensure that¦10956 they would be removed from his son Yitshak. Then¦10950 he left everything \add else\add* he owned to Yitshak.
