\v 21 \add Yitshak's men\add* dug¦11721 another¦11723 well¦11722, but¦11721 they¦11724 quarrelled¦11724 over it too, so he¦11728 named it ‘Sitnah¦11730’ \add (which means ‘opposition’)\add*.
