\v 25 So¦11784 Yitshak¦11799 built¦11784 an¦11786 altar¦11786 there and he¦11787 prayed to Yahweh¦11789. He¦11790 set up his tents¦11793 there and his slaves¦11797 dug¦11794 a well¦11800 there.
\s1 Abimilik wants a commitment from Yitshak
