\p
\v 30 Then¦12381 just as Yitshak¦12384 had finished¦12383 blessing¦12385 Yacob, and¦12381 as Yacob had only¦12390 just gone¦12392 out¦12391 from his father's¦12397 presence, his brother Esaw¦12398 his brother \add returned\add* from his hunting¦12401.
