\v 46 Then¦12683 Rebekah¦12684 told her husband Yitshak¦12687, “I'm \add quite\add* disgusted with¦12689 \add those\add* daughters of¦12691 Het. If¦12693 Yacob¦12696 chooses a wife¦12697 like¦12701 Het's¦12692 daughters from¦12702 \add this culture around us here\add*, \add I wouldn't be able to bear it\add*.”
