\p
\v 1 So¦12708 Yitshak¦12709 called¦12708 for Yacob¦12712 and blessed¦12713 him, and instructed¦12715 him, “Don't¦12718 take¦12720 a wife¦12721 from¦12722 the¦12722 Canaanite¦12723 girls.
