\v 9 so \add he\add* went¦12847 to¦12849 Yishma'el and he took¦12852 Mahalath¦12855 as an additional wife. She was the daughter¦12857 of Abraham's¦12862 son¦12860 Yishma'el¦12851, and was the sister¦12863 of Nevayot¦12864.
\s1 Yacob's vision at Beyt-El
