\p
\v 31 \add Now\add* Yahweh¦13574 saw¦13573 that¦13575 Le'ah¦13578 was spurned, so he¦13579 \add allowed her to conceive\add*, but¦13573 Rahel¦13583 was \add unable to get pregnant\add*.
