\v 1 Now¦13686 Rahel¦13674 \add realised\add* that¦13675 she wasn't \add producing any\add* children for¦13688 Yacob, so she envied¦13679 her¦13681 sister¦13681 \add Le'ah\add*, and she \add demanded from\add* Yacob, “Give me¦13688 children, and if¦13690 \add you don't\add*, I'll die¦13693!”
