\v 3 \add Rahel answered\add*, “Listen, \add here's\add* my slave Bilhah¦13716. \add Sleep with\add* her so¦13719 that¦13719 she'll \add have children on my behalf\add* and¦13713 I'll also¦13723 \add be able to have a family through\add* her.”
