\v 9 \add Now when\add* Le'ah¦13792 \add noticed\add* that¦13793 she \add wasn't getting pregnant any more\add*, she gave¦13801 her¦13800 female slave Zilpah¦13799 to¦13803 Yacob¦13803 as a \add slave\add* wife.
