\p
\v 14 \add One day during\add* the wheat¦13848 harvest¦13846, Reuben¦13844 went¦13843 out and found¦13849 \add some\add* mandrake¦13850 \add plants\add*\f + \fr 30:14 \ft The mandrake plants were believed to increase fertility, but it's not clear from the text which part of the plant was used or how they were applied.\f* in¦13845 the countryside¦13851 and brought¦13852 them¦13853 \add home\add* to¦13854 Le'ah his¦13857 mother¦13857. Then¦13843 Rahel¦13859 \add asked\add* Le'ah, “Please¦13865 give¦13863 me¦13866 some of¦13868 your¦13868 son's¦13868 mandrakes¦13850.”
