\p
\v 25 \add Sometime\add* after Rahel¦14020 had¦14019 given birth to Yosef¦14023, Yacob¦14025 said¦14024 to Lavan¦14028, “Send¦14029 me¦14029 off¦14029 \add now\add*, so¦14030 that¦14030 I¦14030 can \add return\add* to my place¦14033 and¦14017 to my land¦14034.
