\v 32 Let¦14137 me¦14137 look through all your¦14140 flocks¦14140 today and separate out from¦14143 them all the lambs¦14155 that are speckled, spotted, or dark-coloured, and all the young goats¦14158 that are spotted or speckled. They¦14142 will¦14142 be my¦14160 pay.
\v 33 \add So\add* in the future¦14167, you'll be able to see that I've been honest¦14165 because¦14168 you'll be able to see it for¦14164 yourself: any goat¦14181 that's not speckled¦14179 and spotted¦14180, and any sheep that's not dark-coloured, if¦14168 it's¦14178 in my¦14165 flock then¦14162 it must¦14162 have been stolen¦14184.”
