\p
\v 19 When¦19235 Yosef's master¦19237 heard¦19236 his wife¦19241 tell what his slave¦19251 \add had tried\add* to do¦19248 to her, he¦19248 \add became furious\add*.
\v 20 \add He\add* took¦19255 him and¦19255 threw him into¦19260 the prison¦19263 \add built\add* for the king's¦19269 prisoners¦19275.
