\v 22 but¦19704 he¦19707 had the chief¦19705 of the bakers¦19706 executed, just¦19708 like Yosef¦19711 had \add described in the interpretation of the dream\add*.
\v 23 \add However,\add* the chief¦19716 of¦19716 the cupbearers¦19718 \add completely\add* forgot¦19722 about¦19716 Yosef¦19721.
\c 41
